# 📊 AdventureWorks Customer Data Analysis – SQL EDA

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on performing **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)** on the **AdventureWorks Customer dataset** using **MySQL**.

The objective is to analyze customer demographics, income, education, occupation, homeownership, marital status, and age to identify meaningful patterns and generate **business-oriented insights using SQL**.

The project demonstrates practical SQL skills required for **Data Analyst, Business Intelligence, and Data Engineering roles**.

