# 2️⃣ Age Analysis

The age analysis examines the distribution and characteristics of customers based on age.

The analysis includes:

* Minimum age
* Maximum age
* Average age
* Age group segmentation
* Customer distribution across age groups

Age groups were created using SQL `CASE WHEN` statements.

Example:

```sql
CASE
    WHEN Age BETWEEN 40 AND 49 THEN '40-49'
    WHEN Age BETWEEN 50 AND 59 THEN '50-59'
    WHEN Age BETWEEN 60 AND 69 THEN '60-69'
    WHEN Age BETWEEN 70 AND 79 THEN '70-79'
    WHEN Age >= 80 THEN '80+'
    ELSE 'Other'
END AS AgeGroup
```

